# Licensing

This repository uses a dual-license structure.

## Software and source code

Original software, analysis scripts, utilities, and test code authored
for this project (`src/`, `tests/`, `manuscript/make_figures.py`, and
other original executable scripts) are licensed under the MIT License.

See: `LICENSE-MIT`

## Research and documentation

Original manuscript text, documentation, figures, and other original
research content authored for this project (`docs/`, `results/`,
`manuscript/` excluding third-party data, and this repository's README)
are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
License (CC BY 4.0).

See: `LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0`

## Third-party materials

Third-party datasets, source materials, and other externally authored
content are not relicensed by this repository and remain subject to
their original licenses, terms of use, and attribution requirements.

In particular, the underlying insect monitoring dataset
(van Klink et al. 2020, CC BY 4.0, Knowledge Network for Biocomplexity,
DOI: 10.5063/F11V5C9V — see `docs/DATA_PROVENANCE.md`) is third-party
research data and is not covered by the MIT or CC BY 4.0 licenses in
this repository. It is not committed to this repository (see
`data/README.md`) and must not be described as MIT- or CC-BY-4.0-licensed
project content.
